<!--
    French. English in res/values is the fallback for anything missing here.

    French runs longer than English and its uppercase labels are wider, so the
    short buttons use the idiomatic short form ("REPRENDRE", "ASTUCE") rather
    than a literal rendering of the English. Those buttons are fixed height and
    wrap at two lines, so a third line would be clipped.
-->
